{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Synthetics : Mecha VR",
    "steam_appid": 2991360,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2991360/extras/f9e59d6acb541c19a469a7a79ed7af83.avif?t=1745448233\" data-has-big width=800 height=428 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go into the world beyond the apocalypse, and become a Synthetic! A new creation that blurs the line between machine and nature! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These Synthetics pilot massive machines. Giving them immense power over the battlefield.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But there's notions of a ghost haunting the most powerful pilots. Taking the strange power between the machine and pilot! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2991360/extras/7900b62b63c964e3565162a7b67347fb.poster.avif?t=1745448233\" width=800 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2991360/extras/7900b62b63c964e3565162a7b67347fb.webm?t=1745448233\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2991360/extras/7900b62b63c964e3565162a7b67347fb.mp4?t=1745448233\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can customize your mech. Replace your arms, legs, chest, head or boosters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attach  cannons the size of your mech, missiles, Gatling guns, or axe's that rip apart limbs in a single slice!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conquer the battle-field as a truly full armored mech!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2991360/extras/ce619d62bda15375f59b0699decfc8f3.poster.avif?t=1745448233\" width=600 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2991360/extras/ce619d62bda15375f59b0699decfc8f3.webm?t=1745448233\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2991360/extras/ce619d62bda15375f59b0699decfc8f3.mp4?t=1745448233\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize to carry as much destruction as you can...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before your mech is torn limb from limb!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just because other pilots don't have a life, doesn't mean they wont take yours!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2991360/extras/f9e59d6acb541c19a469a7a79ed7af83.avif?t=1745448233\" data-has-big width=800 height=428 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go into the world beyond the apocalypse, and become a Synthetic! A new creation that blurs the line between machine and nature! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These Synthetics pilot massive machines. Giving them immense power over the battlefield.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But there's notions of a ghost haunting the most powerful pilots. Taking the strange power between the machine and pilot! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2991360/extras/7900b62b63c964e3565162a7b67347fb.poster.avif?t=1745448233\" width=800 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2991360/extras/7900b62b63c964e3565162a7b67347fb.webm?t=1745448233\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2991360/extras/7900b62b63c964e3565162a7b67347fb.mp4?t=1745448233\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can customize your mech. Replace your arms, legs, chest, head or boosters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attach  cannons the size of your mech, missiles, Gatling guns, or axe's that rip apart limbs in a single slice!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conquer the battle-field as a truly full armored mech!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2991360/extras/ce619d62bda15375f59b0699decfc8f3.poster.avif?t=1745448233\" width=600 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2991360/extras/ce619d62bda15375f59b0699decfc8f3.webm?t=1745448233\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2991360/extras/ce619d62bda15375f59b0699decfc8f3.mp4?t=1745448233\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize to carry as much destruction as you can...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before your mech is torn limb from limb!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just because other pilots don't have a life, doesn't mean they wont take yours!</p>",
    "short_description": "Put on your VR headset, get inside the humongous humanoid machines, and go into the post-post-apocalypse world of Synthetic. Fight challenging building sized enemies. use the wide customizable arsenal of weaponry available, from shoulder missile launchers to arm Gatling guns!",
